    "The Network → Speed Test runs against this OpenSpeedTest server. Self-host one for free (no third parties, unlimited): `docker run --rm -p 3000:3000 openspeedtest/latest`, then enter its address (e.g. http://192.168.1.50:3000).": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Speedtest unter „Netzwerk“ läuft gegen diesen OpenSpeedTest-Server. Selbst hosten ist kostenlos (keine Dritten, unbegrenzt): `docker run --rm -p 3000:3000 openspeedtest/latest`, danach dessen Adresse eingeben (z. B. http://192.168.1.50:3000)."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La prueba de Red → Prueba de velocidad se ejecuta contra este servidor de OpenSpeedTest. Aloja uno tú mismo gratis (sin terceros, sin límites): `docker run --rm -p 3000:3000 openspeedtest/latest` y luego introduce su dirección (p. ej. http://192.168.1.50:3000)."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le test de débit (Réseau → Test de débit) s'exécute sur ce serveur OpenSpeedTest. Hébergez-le vous-même gratuitement (aucun tiers, illimité) : `docker run --rm -p 3000:3000 openspeedtest/latest`, puis saisissez son adresse (p. ex. http://192.168.1.50:3000)."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rete → Test di velocità viene eseguito su questo server OpenSpeedTest. Puoi ospitarne uno gratuitamente (nessuna terza parte, senza limiti): `docker run --rm -p 3000:3000 openspeedtest/latest`, poi inserisci il suo indirizzo (es. http://192.168.1.50:3000)."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「ネットワーク」→「速度テスト」は、この OpenSpeedTest サーバーに対して実行されます。無料で自己ホストできます（第三者を経由せず、無制限）: `docker run --rm -p 3000:3000 openspeedtest/latest` を実行し、そのアドレス（例: http://192.168.1.50:3000）を入力してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "네트워크 → 속도 테스트는 이 OpenSpeedTest 서버를 사용해 실행됩니다. 무료로 직접 호스팅할 수 있습니다(제3자 없음, 무제한): `docker run --rm -p 3000:3000 openspeedtest/latest`를 실행한 다음 해당 주소를 입력하세요(예: http://192.168.1.50:3000)."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O Rede → Teste de Velocidade é executado neste servidor OpenSpeedTest. Hospede o seu gratuitamente (sem terceiros, sem limites): `docker run --rm -p 3000:3000 openspeedtest/latest` e informe o endereço dele (ex.: http://192.168.1.50:3000)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网络 → 测速将通过此 OpenSpeedTest 服务器进行。你可以免费自建一个（不经过第三方，无使用限制）：`docker run --rm -p 3000:3000 openspeedtest/latest`，然后输入其地址（例如 http://192.168.1.50:3000）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same support and feedback options, in a window you can keep around while writing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieselben Support- und Feedback-Optionen, in einem Fenster, das beim Schreiben geöffnet bleiben kann."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las mismas opciones de soporte y comentarios, en una ventana que puedes dejar abierta mientras escribes."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les mêmes options d'assistance et de commentaires, dans une fenêtre que vous pouvez garder ouverte pendant la rédaction."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le stesse opzioni di supporto e feedback, in una finestra che puoi tenere aperta mentre scrivi."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同じサポートとフィードバックの項目を、入力中も開いたままにできるウインドウで表示します。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "동일한 지원 및 피드백 옵션을, 작성하는 동안 계속 열어 둘 수 있는 창에서 제공합니다."
